# <FILE>target/linux/bcm4908/patches-6.12/410-rt-ac86u-boot-led-handoff.patch</FILE> - <DESC>Animate completed boot LED waypoints before normal policy.</DESC>
# <VERS>VERSION: 0.3.0</VERS>
# <WCTX>Complete the boot sequence asynchronously without delaying other services.</WCTX>
# <CLOG>Accept one exact complete command that atomically finalizes healthy startup and starts the existing animation.</CLOG>

--- a/drivers/leds/blink/leds-bcm63138.c
+++ b/drivers/leds/blink/leds-bcm63138.c
